</div>
<h2 id="return">The Return</h2>
<p>Donald announced his comeback on Instagram, more than two years after walking away from football in March 2024 following a decade with the Rams. He's signing a one-year contract worth $20 million guaranteed that can climb to $30 million with incentives — a deal that came together after the Rams traded for reigning Defensive Player of the Year Myles Garrett this summer, which reportedly helped stoke Donald's comeback interest. The Rams spent nearly two months letting Donald test his body at the team facility before finalizing the deal.</p>
<div class="stat-card">
<div class="stat-icon">🐏</div>
